        "original_id": "62e8a036-5e1f-5eae-a9fb-693f671f6864",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Bands: CKY, Violent Femmes\n- People: Deron Miller, Chad I Ginsburg, Jess Margera, Matt Deis, Gordon Gano\n- Albums: Carver City, Violent Femmes\n- Songs: \"Gone Daddy Gone\"\n- Places: Milwaukee, Wisconsin, Pennsylvania\n\nFacts:\n- Violent Femmes is an American folk punk band from Milwaukee, Wisconsin, and the band was initially active from 1980 to 2009.\n- In 1983, Violent Femmes recorded \"Gone Daddy Gone\" for their eponymous debut album, and Gordon Gano wrote the song.\n- CKY was formed in 1998 by Deron Miller, Chad I Ginsburg, and Jess Margera.\n- Carver City is the fourth studio album by the Pennsylvania alternative metal band CKY.\n- CKY currently features Chad I Ginsburg, Jess Margera, and Matt Deis.",
